WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.560
In the final years of Shang, the power of Zhou gradually grew stronger.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:08.990
King Wu of Zhou cared for the people and won the support of many.

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:13.204
On the other side, King Zhou had lost the hearts of the people.

00:00:13.554 --> 00:00:18.498
Many tribes hoped the world would see a new change.

00:00:18.848 --> 00:00:23.312
King Wu united with other tribes and decided to campaign against King Zhou.

00:00:23.662 --> 00:00:28.222
They agreed to meet the Shang army at Muye.

00:00:28.572 --> 00:00:32.172
On the day of the decisive encounter, the two sides met at Muye.

00:00:32.522 --> 00:00:36.074
The Shang army was large, and the atmosphere was extremely tense.

00:00:36.424 --> 00:00:41.416
Many Shang soldiers were unwilling to fight, and one after another they laid down their weapons.

00:00:41.766 --> 00:00:46.542
The Battle of Muye ended quickly, and the Shang dynasty fell with it.

00:00:46.892 --> 00:00:50.756
King Wu defeated Shang and founded the Zhou dynasty.

00:00:51.106 --> 00:00:57.802
Later generations linked the change of dynasties with the ruler's Mandate of Heaven.

